"Kant urged the twins to kill Caden but is forbidden to act against Caden directly."
"Kant says freeing the augera would end arcanophany and the Empire; he is bound to inaction."
"Kant reads lies, copies any sequence he sees, and can ensorcel a body into total control."
"Kant once beat Reeves in an arcana duel, and watches duels undercover."
"Now: Kant is teaching thaumaturgy; he left the day's first session in a hurry."
"Celwyn worked under Reeves on the weaving that hid the Chosen One."
"Celwyn is bitter at the turn to thaumaturgy; Bertram has sold artefacts she made."
"Celwyn and colleagues built the hidden-glyph Advanced Glyphs rooms; she has long taught Bertram."
"Now: Celwyn is teaching Special Set theory in a lecture hall this term."
"Ward warned Caden that the Demiurge may goad him into running before he can walk."
"Ward teaches rushed healing to conscripts under the Empire's new policy on healers."
"Ward judged Caden's heal that grew flare-like veins in a puppet 'within parameters'."
"Now: Ward is teaching healing; he set the bruise sequence as reading for his next class."
