"Caden's ensorcelment bound Everett into the Major Prophecy, fated to lose his son and ruin himself."
"Everett's orbs died once he gave one to Caden; he still floats them and refuses every buyer."
"Everett remembers Caden fully; the Prophecy compels him to favour guarding the augera network."
"Everett helped Reeves with the weaving and can summon an unstable wysana of his own."
"Everett is a first-generation arcanist who loses himself pacing in his 'manias'."
"Now: Everett is most likely at his staff residence on campus for the new term, home at weekends."
